### Complex Equations
• Gaussian integral: ∫₋∞∞ e⁻ˣ^² dx = √π
• Summation formula: ∑ᵢ₌₁ⁿ i = (n(n+1))/2
• Quadratic equation: x = (-b ± √(b² - 4ac))/2a
• Vectors & Matrix multiplication: A ∈ ℝᵐ × ⁿ and x ∈ ℝⁿ

